Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: restic
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Ahmadlolbit/hyprtrixie
Description: Back up your home folder with restic, from Hyprtrixie
 restic-backup sets up where the backups go (a folder, a USB drive, s3:,
 b2: or rclone:), backs up your home folder, and lists, restores, mounts,
 checks and prunes the backups. It can also back up by itself whenever
 the backup drive is plugged in.
